// A mole standing on a turning belt is carried along with it, like a moving floor. A counterweight drives the
// belt; the mole stands still on it and rides to the right at the belt's 1 m/s (4 tiles/s), staying on its feet.
// (Before, the belt ran under the mole and it stood where it was.)
map
################################
################################
#....jjjjjjjjjj*...............#
#..............j...............#
#..............j...............#
#..............j...............#
#..............j...............#
#..............j...............#
#..............j...............#
#..............j..@............#
#..............*>>>>>>>>>>>....#
################################
end
give Counterweight 1
place 2 -14 -7 Counterweight
expect 30 turning:1,1 == 1
expect 30 px > 19.5
expect 90 px > 23.5                // 4 tiles a second along the belt
expect 90 px < 24.5
expect 90 grounded == 1
